<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.3.4">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" /><link href="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en" /><updated>2026-06-20T15:34:54+00:00</updated><id>https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/feed.xml</id><title type="html">The Best Running Podcasts 2026</title><subtitle>An independent, hand-curated directory of the best running podcasts—road, track, trail, ultra, skyrunning, and training science. Each entry is reviewed for quality and usefulness for runners, coaches, and fans. Filter by training focus and language, discover Spotify and Apple Podcasts links, and find shows worth your long run.
